      <species id="mwda9d8bda_79d8_4bf6_ad9b_bb05c192be10" name="qPSC" compartment="mwd4c54e3d_3810_4f3b_931e_90c5a580780e" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Quiescent pancreatic stellate cells in tumor compartment. In normal pancreas, PSCs store vitamin A and maintain stromal homeostasis.</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mw4e1db893_18cc_49cb_a465_c2b975df01be" name="iCAF" compartment="mwd4c54e3d_3810_4f3b_931e_90c5a580780e" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Inflammatory cancer-associated fibroblasts. Secrete IL-6 and CXCL12, driving MDSC recruitment, M2 polarization, and CXCR4-mediated T-cell exclusion (Elyada 2019, Ogawa 2021). Driven by tumor-derived IL-1alpha; TGFb antagonizes via IL-1R1 repression.</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mw62fa5b38_73ef_4923_b2de_91f6927d0391" name="myCAF" compartment="mwd4c54e3d_3810_4f3b_931e_90c5a580780e" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Myofibroblastic cancer-associated fibroblasts. Secrete ECM (collagen), TGFb, VEGF. Build desmoplastic barrier. Favored by TGFb signaling (Biffi 2019). (CXCL12 is iCAF-derived, not myCAF -- audit m2-A-ECM-01.)</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mwba4d837b_5b5e_4180_bf70_a1eb9b4db4bf" name="apCAF" compartment="mwd4c54e3d_3810_4f3b_931e_90c5a580780e" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Antigen-presenting cancer-associated fibroblasts. Express MHC-II, present tumor antigen tolerogenically -&gt; Treg induction. Rarest subtype ~2-5% of CAFs (Elyada 2019).</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mw225e6a5a_d7a8_4c0e_a7ce_cba97c69aca4" name="collagen" compartment="mwd4c54e3d_3810_4f3b_931e_90c5a580780e" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWBUILTINPREFIX_milli_MWBUILTINUNIT_gram" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Fibrillar collagen (types I/III) in tumor (total mass in mg). Primary structural ECM component driving desmoplasia. Determines pore size (immune exclusion) and stiffness (mechanotransduction).</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mw3787edad_52f9_4fb6_8b90_a2381f359c2c" name="CXCL12" compartment="mwd4c54e3d_3810_4f3b_931e_90c5a580780e" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">CXCL12/SDF-1 chemokine secreted by iCAFs. Major T cell exclusion mechanism in PDAC via CXCR4 signaling (Elyada 2019, Ogawa 2021).</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
      <species id="mw8cf1fb89_fee3_4c00_a4d1_b8dd9c6aa964" name="IL6" compartment="mwd4c54e3d_3810_4f3b_931e_90c5a580780e" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
